         </title>
         <description>
            <p>
               DEV beta package. Installs BatchSTFStretch 1.0.0-beta2, ImageBatchManager 3.2-beta1, and MatchOpenImageSizes 1.0.4 under Script &gt; Chapel Astro Utilities.
               BatchSTFStretch is the renamed batch screen-stretch utility. ImageBatchManager save-only now asks for a destination folder for newly created images while preserving existing source folders for opened images.
